# Optional desktop / graphical packages for Grapefruit OS
# Include this list when building a graphical live image.
# For a minimal server/agent image, omit it.

# Display & input
xorg
xserver-xorg
xserver-xorg-input-all
xserver-xorg-video-all
mesa-utils

# Lightweight graphical session options (choose later)
# sway
# labwc
# waybar
# wofi

# Fallback / common tools
lightdm
lightdm-gtk-greeter

# Fonts & basic theming
fonts-dejavu
fonts-liberation
fonts-noto-core

# Useful graphical utilities
firefox
# or a more privacy-oriented browser later

# Note: The final desktop direction (tiling Wayland compositor vs
# traditional DE) is still open. This list is intentionally modest.
